          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "In the US, Ballistol was originally sold as Ballistol Lube and Sportsman’s Lube. It quickly became the CLP of choice for black powder shooters. Today, Ballistol USA is sold in over 2k retail locations as Ballistol Multi-Purpose Oil. Whether you need to clean a firearm, prevent rust, rejuvenate leather, waterproof boots, loosen a rusty bolt, fix a squeaky hinge…Ballistol does it all.",
